div.p:
—Hua Kuo-feng has yet to identify himself with many of Teng’s policies and key
                    ideological formulations and has on several occasions seemed to support
                    modification of the policies by stressing the Maoist heritage;

—The policies themselves have been implemented unevenly, probably because many
                    bureaucrats believe these policies lack staying power and hence are unwilling to
                    identify with them;
